    "quote": "I don't paint what I see — I paint what I feel.",
    "badge": "The Artist",
    "title": "Painting Since Childhood",
    "paragraph1": "Art has always been my first language. Long before I had the words to express what I felt, I had colors, lines, and the patience of a blank canvas waiting to become something special. I started painting as a child — not because I was taught, but because I couldn't stop.",
